	(text "Decoupling (DS12288 Fig. 16): C24-C26 100 nF, one per VDD pin, + C27 4.7 uF;\nC28 10 nF + C29 1 uF on VDDA; C30 100 nF + C31 1 uF on VREF+ (tied to VDDA, VREFBUF off).\nVBAT tied to VDD (no battery, 3.11.6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 58.42 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "218c1794-7b79-4c14-a11d-007fe28eb55f")
	)
	(text "HSE 16 MHz, CL 9 pF, ESR 50 Ohm, C0 3 pF: gm_crit = 0.29 mA/V < 1.5 mA/V (Table 41).\nC32 = C33 = 2 x (CL - Cstray 4 pF) = 10 pF C0G (AN2867). Check frequency on the first board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 124.46 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "55ea9a47-1591-4620-819e-1299bb8920f2")
	)
	(text "NRST: 100 nF (Fig. 27), internal 40k pull-up.\nBOOT0 (PB8): 10k pull-down; bridge JP1 at power-up for ROM DFU over USB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 172.72 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f51a979c-59bd-4098-b800-654b240c0d0a")
	)
	(text "J6: 2.54 mm pads for debugging only, Nucleo ST-LINK CN4 order\n(VDD, SWCLK, GND, SWDIO, NRST). Not fitted: hand-solder a header if needed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 218.44 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9b8f85bf-fcd6-43d2-b551-386be9cdd6d9")
	)
	(text "D4 green = pins 1-3, red = pins 2-4 (Lite-On drawing).\n(3.3 V - 2.0 V) / 330 Ohm = 4 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 248.92 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "87c6fdb7-5515-458b-ad77-a60f9e9ce353")
	)
	(text "CSA outputs: 100 Ohm + 1 nF C0G, tau = 100 ns (sample window >= 2 us).\nSOx_ADC feed the ADCs and COMP1/3/4 (overcurrent) -> TIM1 BKIN.\nVBUS: 100k (0603, 75 V) / 5.1k: 3.3 V at 68 V full scale, 16.6 mV/count; 1 nF, tau 4.9 us.\nNTC: 10k pull-up, TH1 (Bridge sheet) to GND, 1 nF filter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 177.8 0.0000)
		(effects
